---
/**
 * Light/dark switch, with the framework ThemeToggle's markup and storage
 * (`localStorage['fw-theme']`, the `dark` class and `data-theme` on <html>).
 * ../client/shell.ts sets its icon and label once it knows the current scheme.
 */
---

<button type="button" class="fw-theme-toggle" aria-label="Toggle theme" aria-pressed="false" data-fw-theme-toggle>
  <span class="fw-theme-toggle-icon" aria-hidden="true">☀</span>
</button>
